# INVWINDT.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the drag's
# threshold in the split view's contents.  A press moved 4 pixels and
# released is a click: no drag, the row selected.  Moved 5 down, or 5
# left, the drag starts, and ESC ends it.  A double click still opens
# the row's item, which ESC closes.  A drag across the contents' own
# rows keeps their selection.  F1's help window, opening on a press not
# yet dragged, ends the box's own press.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINDT.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/dragchk.py checks
# it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-L B
S LOCS
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 1 4 0
S FOUR
M 221.1 UP ROW 1 4 0
S CLICK
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 1 0 5
S FIVEDOWN
K ESC
S DOWNESC
M 221.1 UP ROW 1 0 5
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 1 -5 0
S FIVELEFT
K ESC
S LEFTESC
M 221.1 UP ROW 1 -5 0
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 UP ROW 0
M 221.1 DBL ROW 0
S DBLOPEN
K ESC
S DBLESC
M 221.1 UP ROW 0
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 2
S OWNROWS
K ESC
S OWNESC
M 221.1 UP ROW 2
S OWNUP
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
K F1
S ARMF1
K ESC
M 221.1 UP ROW 0
S ARMF1UP
K ALT-F X
